# Env files at any depth. The root-only patterns above let `COPY server/ .`
# (Dockerfile.server) or `COPY . .` (frontend build) carry a local
# server/.env into an image built from a working copy. The committed
# examples hold no secrets.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env*.example

# Local database backups — never baked into an image
server/data
